# Skill 运行时依赖（npm install 产物，不入库；需要时在 skills/*/ 下重新安装）
skills/.system/
skills/*/node_modules/
skills/*/package-lock.json
packages/redtrace-dsh/lib/
# Per-skill memory runtime lock (ephemeral, created by learn())
skills/*/memory/.lock/
# Playwright 测试产物
test-results/
playwright-report/
skills/pentest-tools/tools/burp-mcp-full/.gradle/

# 根目录 npm 依赖产物（不入库）
node_modules/

# tools/ - 大型运行时工具（bin/wordlists/poc 等），不入库
tools/*
!tools/tool_list.md
!tools/scripts/

# 本地 agent 工具状态（freebuff/mimocode CLI）
